twine: rebrand AFFiNE -> Twine across user-visible surfaces

Adds scripts/rebrand.mjs as a re-runnable, idempotent rename pass that
operates only on i18n JSON values, the PWA manifest, and Electron
productName/description. Internal `@affine/*` package names, env vars,
class names, and source-code identifiers are intentionally left alone
so upstream merges from toeverything/AFFiNE stay clean.

Also drops the misleading "AFFiNE Cloud" wording on self-host (the
banner now says "Sign in to sync it to your Twine server" instead of
"enable cloud now"), and replaces the admin auth/setup logo SVGs with
neutral Twine wordmark placeholders.

Run with: node scripts/rebrand.mjs
